  "description": "# SIP2.24: Add 2 Arks to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 2 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Number of Arks to add: 2\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x679794389B05B0db3CbEdAcC908ff8Fb531fA53f`\n2. `0x61d7063041d83C8ca3E42c39181dFd14B3Bc76c2`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-24-update-arks-from-core-protocols-on-mainnet-fleets-usdc-weth-usdt/330\n",
